# ── Master-reconciliation blueprint package (2026-09-20/21), added 2026-09-21 ──
# Same class as the Creator Brains block above: an AI-HANDOFF package whose
# provenance, receipts and evidence reproduce the operator's local machine paths
# verbatim. Redacting them would falsify the audit trail (rule 51) — the absolute
# paths are part of what binds the package to the revisions it describes.
# All nine hit lines were read before allowlisting. Every one is a local
# `.../Users/<operator>/...` path string: four provenance/receipt rows, one
# `--repo-path` invocation in a recorded command, two mandate-file paths, and two
# lane-register references. No credential of any kind is present.
# Identity-only allowlist — NO credential pattern is allowlisted. An equivalent
# scan over the same staged blobs returned 0 matches on all 17 credential
# patterns (anthropic/openai/google/slack/stripe/github/aws, db URLs, JWT, PEM).
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/BLUEPRINT-master-reconciliation-2026-09-20/CONSULT-PACKET.md::operator-identity
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/BLUEPRINT-master-reconciliation-2026-09-20/FILE-RECEIPT.md::operator-identity
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/BLUEPRINT-master-reconciliation-2026-09-20/MANDATE-PRIOR-SNAPSHOT.md::operator-identity
